meta {
  name: Useful Create
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/usefuls/create
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept-Language: oz
}

body:multipart-form {
  title_oz: Davlat portali
  title_ru: Государственный портал
  title_uz: Давлат портали
  title_en: Government portal
  sort_order: 0
  status: true
  ~files: @file(_samples/sample.png)
  ~lang: oz
}

docs {
  **multipart/form-data** — Useful'da `Files` bor, shuning uchun create JSON EMAS.

  | Maydon | Turi | Cheklov |
  |---|---|---|
  | `title_oz/ru/uz/en` | matn | max 255, ixtiyoriy |
  | `sort_order` | int | standart 0 |
  | `status` | bool | standart true |
  | `files` | fayl | jpg/jpeg/png/webp max 5MB, **svg max 2MB**, 100 tagacha |
  | `lang` | matn | har bir faylga til (oz\|ru\|uz\|en\|all) — FAYL SONI BILAN TENG |

  Logotip uchun `svg` ham ruxsat etilgan (boshqa modullarda yo'q).

  Keyinchalik rasm qo'shish uchun `11-Media` papkasi (`table` = `usefuls`).
}
